{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 126152, "name": "Prabal Dev", "username": "devprabal", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/{size}/15950_2.png", "created_at": "2020-04-05T09:05:16.047Z", "cooked": "<p>I installed <code>kde</code> by <code>dnf install @kde-desktop</code>  hoping to get rid of this <a href=\"https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/boot-image-boot-vmlinuz-5-6-0-rc5-git0-2-fc32-x86-64-crashed/70273/6\">issue</a> following this <a href=\"https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/boot-image-boot-vmlinuz-5-6-0-rc5-git0-2-fc32-x86-64-crashed/70273/4\">reply</a>.<br>\nHowever, neither the issue was resolved nor do I like kde-desktop.<br>\nI tried to remove it by undoing the transaction ID like - <code>sudo dnf history undo</code><br>\nBut then it says</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">No package @kde-desktop installed.\nError: no package matched\n</code></pre>\n<p>How should I cleanly remove kde without affecting the dependencies that gnome relies on too?</p>\n<p>I think I should not do <code> dnf remove @kde-desktop</code> because that will also remove a hell lot of other applications like Xorg, etc which the gnome-de depends on too.</p>\n<p>If I do <code>dnf remove kde-* qt-* plasma-*</code> then I fear that it won’t be a clean uninstall and will leave me unable to undo the transaction by which I installed the kde-desktop.</p>\n<p>I am using fedora32-beta fresh install.</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2023-06-22T21:56:05.647Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 34799, "reads": 171, "readers_count": 170, "score": 173981.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "Prabal Dev", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/boot-image-boot-vmlinuz-5-6-0-rc5-git0-2-fc32-x86-64-crashed/70273/6", "internal": true, "reflection": false, "title": "BOOT_IMAGE=/boot/vmlinuz-5.6.0-rc5.git0.2.fc32.x86_64 crashed", "clicks": 64}, {"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/boot-image-boot-vmlinuz-5-6-0-rc5-git0-2-fc32-x86-64-crashed/70273/4", "internal": true, "reflection": false, "title": "BOOT_IMAGE=/boot/vmlinuz-5.6.0-rc5.git0.2.fc32.x86_64 crashed", "clicks": 14}, {"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/fedora-jam-install-xfce-desktop/141685/23", "internal": true, "reflection": true, "title": "Fedora Jam - install xfce desktop", "clicks": 6}, {"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/how-to-uninstall-random-leftover-kde-packages-running-in-the-background/196692/3", "internal": true, "reflection": true, "title": "How to uninstall random leftover KDE packages running in the background?", "clicks": 1}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10454, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 128942, "name": "ersen", "username": "ersen", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-04-05T12:54:07.927Z", "cooked": "<p>Error message says <code>kde-desktop</code> group is not installed. Can you mark it as installed with <code>sudo dnf group mark install kde-desktop</code> and try <code>sudo dnf history undo</code> again?</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2020-04-05T12:54:07.927Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 134, "reads": 164, "readers_count": 163, "score": 707.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "ersen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 1379, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/2", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 178432, "name": "ersen", "username": "ersen", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-04-05T13:00:46.424Z", "cooked": "<p>And can you post <code>sudo dnf history</code>, at least last couple ones, in case that didn’t solve the issue?</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2020-04-05T13:00:46.424Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 93, "reads": 161, "readers_count": 160, "score": 497.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "ersen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 1379, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/3", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 191253, "name": "Prabal Dev", "username": "devprabal", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/{size}/15950_2.png", "created_at": "2020-04-05T18:35:34.128Z", "cooked": "<p>I did as told by <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ersen\">@ersen</a>.<br>\nHere is the trimmed output of  <code>sudo dnf history undo 31</code> -</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Last metadata expiration check: 0:01:27 ago on Sun 05 Apr 2020 11:56:03 PM IST.<br>\nUndoing transaction 31, from Sat 04 Apr 2020 11:17:56 PM IST<br>\nInstall NetworkManager-l2tp-1.8.2-1.fc32.x86_64                       <span class=\"mention\">@updates-testing</span><br>\nInstall appstream-0.12.10-1.fc32.x86_64                               <span class=\"mention\">@updates-testing</span><br>\n…<br>\nNo package breeze-icon-theme-5.67.0-1.fc32.noarch installed.<br>\nNo package <span class=\"mention\">@kde-desktop</span> installed.<br>\nNo package kf5-attica-5.67.0-1.fc32.x86_64 installed.<br>\n…<br>\nNo package kf5-threadweaver-5.67.0-1.fc32.x86_64 installed.<br>\nNo package qqc2-desktop-style-5.67.0-1.fc32.x86_64 installed.<br>\nError: no package matched</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p>Here is the list of <code>dnf history</code> -</p>\n<blockquote></blockquote>\n<pre><code>35 | group mark install kde-desktop                                                              | 2020-04-05 23:56 | Install        |    1   \n34 | install dnf-plugin-system-upgrade                                                           | 2020-04-05 14:08 | Install        |    2   \n33 | update --refresh                                                                            | 2020-04-05 13:26 | I, U           |   97   \n32 |                                                                                             | 2020-04-05 12:21 | Upgrade        |    3   \n31 | install @kde-desktop                                                                        | 2020-04-04 23:17 | Install        |  364 EE\n30 | install meson                                                                               | 2020-04-04 22:21 | Install        |    2   \n29 | update                                                                                      | 2020-04-04 20:25 | E, I, U        |   73 EE\n28 | install obs-studio                                                                          | 2020-04-03 21:52 | Install        |    7   \n27 | update                                                                                      | 2020-04-03 21:24 | Upgrade        |    2 EE\n26 | update                                                                                      | 2020-04-02 15:40 | Upgrade        |   47 EE\n25 | install torbrowser-launcher-0.3.2-12.fc32.noarch                                            | 2020-04-02 00:52 | Install        |   19   \n24 | install vlc                                                                                 | 2020-04-02 00:25 | Install        |   30   \n23 | groupupdate Multimedia                                                                      | 2020-04-02 00:21 | Install        |   28   \n22 | install cargo                                                                               | 2020-04-01 23:52 | Install        |    3   \n21 |                                                                                             | 2020-04-01 23:42 | Install        |    2   \n20 |                                                                                             | 2020-04-01 23:40 | Install        |    3   \n19 | update                                                                                      | 2020-04-01 21:57 | Upgrade        |   73   \n18 | remove epiphany-1:3.36.0-1.fc32.x86_64                                                      | 2020-03-31 17:17 | Removed        |    2\n</code></pre>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:59:18.471Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 660, "reads": 152, "readers_count": 151, "score": 3330.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "Prabal Dev", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 2633, "username": "penguinnooob", "name": "Rob Smith", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/f5a326/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10454, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [{"id": 1379, "username": "ersen", "name": "ersen", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/{size}.png"}], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/4", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 167490, "name": "ersen", "username": "ersen", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-04-05T18:50:08.411Z", "cooked": "<p>What is the transaction <code>32</code>?  And if you update a package installed at <code>31</code> later in the <code>33</code>, maybe  <code>breeze-icon-theme</code> or others in the error message, <code>history undo</code> fails because it tries to rollback the package with the previous version.</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2020-04-05T18:50:08.411Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 271, "reads": 122, "readers_count": 121, "score": 1429.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "ersen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 1379, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/5", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 133758, "name": "FranciscoD", "username": "ankursinha", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png", "created_at": "2020-04-05T18:50:59.797Z", "cooked": "<p>Try: <code>sudo dnf groupremove \"KDE\"</code>?</p>\n<p>Installing whole desktop environments generally also tries to remove lots of other packages, so do check the transaction first.</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2020-04-05T18:50:59.797Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 188, "reads": 119, "readers_count": 118, "score": 973.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "FranciscoD", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 78, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/6", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 200270, "name": "Prabal Dev", "username": "devprabal", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/{size}/15950_2.png", "created_at": "2020-04-06T03:08:39.081Z", "cooked": "<p>I don’t know what transaction 32, 21 or 20 are. I don’t remember. So should I undo the update (35,34,33) and then undo 31?</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T08:03:02.822Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 157, "reads": 121, "readers_count": 120, "score": 809.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "Prabal Dev", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 2633, "username": "penguinnooob", "name": "Rob Smith", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/f5a326/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10454, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/7", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 165114, "name": "Prabal Dev", "username": "devprabal", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/{size}/15950_2.png", "created_at": "2020-04-06T04:20:12.067Z", "cooked": "<p><code>sudo dnf groupremove \"KDE\"</code><br>\nWarning: Module or Group ‘KDE’ is not installed.<br>\nDependencies resolved.<br>\nNothing to do.<br>\nComplete!</p>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:48:54.064Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 6, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 221, "reads": 116, "readers_count": 115, "score": 1133.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "Prabal Dev", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 2, "username": "sanja", "name": "Sanja", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/db3279/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10454, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/8", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 201622, "name": "Prabal Dev", "username": "devprabal", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/{size}/15950_2.png", "created_at": "2020-04-06T04:56:21.080Z", "cooked": "<p>I have uploaded the output of <code>sudo dnf remove @kde-desktop</code> .</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://paste.centos.org/view/8fa5e85c\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://paste.centos.org/view/8fa5e85c</a></p>\n<p>I haven’t proceeded with the transaction yet.</p>\n<p>The section which says <strong>removing unused dependencies</strong>, are all the packages in it safe to remove?</p>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T08:03:36.563Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 6, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 282, "reads": 115, "readers_count": 114, "score": 1438.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "Prabal Dev", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://paste.centos.org/view/8fa5e85c", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "UNTITLED - Pastebin Service", "clicks": 103}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 2, "username": "sanja", "name": "Sanja", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/db3279/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10454, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/9", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 201141, "name": "ersen", "username": "ersen", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-04-06T05:55:59.194Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"devprabal\" data-post=\"8\" data-topic=\"73757\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/48/15950_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> devprabal:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>sudo dnf groupremove \"KDE\"</code><br>\nWarning: Module or Group ‘KDE’ is not installed.<br>\nDependencies resolved.<br>\nNothing to do.<br>\nComplete!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This fails because name of the group is <code>KDE (K Desktop Environment)</code>.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group quote-modified\" data-username=\"devprabal\" data-post=\"9\" data-topic=\"73757\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/48/15950_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> devprabal:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I have uploaded the output of <code>sudo dnf remove @kde-desktop</code> .</p>\n<p>I haven’t proceeded with the transaction yet.</p>\n<p>The section which says <strong>removing unused dependencies</strong> , are all the packages in it safe to remove?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I have GNOME installed and none of those packages are installed. I also tried to install KDE group and it listed those packages as to be installed.</p>", "post_number": 10, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T22:47:44.152Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 2, "incoming_link_count": 990, "reads": 110, "readers_count": 109, "score": 4987.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "ersen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 1379, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/10", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 176251, "name": "Prabal Dev", "username": "devprabal", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/{size}/15950_2.png", "created_at": "2020-04-06T05:57:50.995Z", "cooked": "<p>so can i do the <code>dnf remove @kde-desktop</code> ?</p>", "post_number": 11, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:53:17.904Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 10, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 992, "reads": 98, "readers_count": 97, "score": 4984.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "Prabal Dev", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 2633, "username": "penguinnooob", "name": "Rob Smith", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/f5a326/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10454, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/11", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 171967, "name": "ersen", "username": "ersen", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-04-06T06:07:31.017Z", "cooked": "<p>I don’t have any on these packages and my system is working fine, so I would say yes, but please backup any important data.</p>", "post_number": 12, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:51:35.789Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 11, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 434, "reads": 93, "readers_count": 92, "score": 2208.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "ersen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 10454, "username": "devprabal", "name": "Prabal Dev", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/{size}/15950_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 1379, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/12", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 125713, "name": "Prabal Dev", "username": "devprabal", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/{size}/15950_2.png", "created_at": "2020-04-06T07:02:13.964Z", "cooked": "<p>I did <code>dnf remove @kde-desktop</code>. It worked like a charm. Cleanly removes the apps and stuffs belonging to KDE while keeping Gnome running uninterrupted. A later reboot also shows no problem in Gnome (Wayland). However, I had to manually remove all the config files KDE apps created in <code>~/.config</code> , <code>~</code> and <code>~/.local</code> dirs.</p>", "post_number": 13, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:33:49.789Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 12, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 220, "reads": 88, "readers_count": 87, "score": 1177.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "Prabal Dev", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 2633, "username": "penguinnooob", "name": "Rob Smith", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/p/f5a326/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 4}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 10454, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/13", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 4}, {"id": "bluethumb", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 4, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 169614, "name": "ersen", "username": "ersen", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/db3279/{size}.png", "created_at": "2020-04-06T08:05:39.685Z", "cooked": "<p>I am glad it worked. <code>dnf</code> never removes files in <code>~/.config</code> and  <code>~/.local</code> in case you want to install those programs later, you need to manually do that.</p>", "post_number": 14, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 14, "updated_at": "2023-03-08T07:50:40.011Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 13, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 92, "reads": 85, "readers_count": 84, "score": 552.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 73757, "topic_slug": "uninstall-kde-cleanly", "display_username": "ersen", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 10454, "username": "devprabal", "name": "Prabal Dev", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/devprabal/{size}/15950_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 3}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 1379, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/uninstall-kde-cleanly/73757/14", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 3}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 3, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 163176, "name": "system", "username": "system", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/